# Commands run by the launchd job com.hakios.demo (see com.hakios.demo.plist).
# Every icon slot of home screen page 2 opened for 5 s and closed with the home button (devices/akita TODO 58) -- one
# swipe to the page at the start: an application closed with the home button comes back to the page it was opened
# from (11-12: a second press and a swipe before each tap ended in the App Library half the time). The host takes
# screenshots meanwhile; the logs are read for the Metal plug-in's refusals, GPU faults and crashes.
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 30 swipe 0.5 0.985 0.5 0.3 200 wait 8 swipe 0.85 0.5 0.15 0.5 200 wait 3
/redwood/bin/rwtouch tap 0.150 0.120 wait 5 button home wait 3 tap 0.385 0.120 wait 5 button home wait 3 tap 0.615 0.120 wait 5 button home wait 3 tap 0.845 0.120 wait 5 button home wait 3
/redwood/bin/rwtouch tap 0.150 0.245 wait 5 button home wait 3 tap 0.385 0.245 wait 5 button home wait 3 tap 0.615 0.245 wait 5 button home wait 3 tap 0.845 0.245 wait 5 button home wait 3
/redwood/bin/rwtouch tap 0.150 0.370 wait 5 button home wait 3 tap 0.385 0.370 wait 5 button home wait 3 tap 0.615 0.370 wait 5 button home wait 3 tap 0.845 0.370 wait 5 button home wait 3
/redwood/bin/rwtouch tap 0.150 0.500 wait 5 button home wait 3 tap 0.385 0.500 wait 5 button home wait 3 tap 0.615 0.500 wait 5 button home wait 3 tap 0.845 0.500 wait 5 button home wait 3
